  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{痩|や}せる (X loses weight).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates state. {痩|や}せて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is thin' (state of being thin, not the process).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {痩|や}せる (lose weight)\n- {痩|や}せて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (is thin—state)\n- {痩|や}せたい (want to lose weight)\n- {痩|や}せすぎ (too thin)\n- ⟦ダイエット→ダイエット：17678_daietto⟧⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧{痩|や}せる (lose weight by dieting)\n\nOPPOSITE: ⟦{太|ふと}る→太る：01190_futoru⟧ (to gain weight)\n\nNUANCE: {痩|や}せて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ can be positive (slim) or negative (too thin) depending on context. More polite alternatives:\n- ⟦スリム→スリム：21695_surimu⟧ (slim—neutral/positive)\n- ⟦{細|ほそ}い→細い：02962_hosoi⟧ (slender—often positive)\n\nKANJI: Often written in hiragana as やせる in casual contexts.",
